# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/terraform.tfvars

# Environment / secrets
**/.env

# Ansible generated inventory
ansible/inventories/generated/

# ansible-lint / ansible-compat cache
ansible/.ansible/
.ansible/

# Build artifacts
dist/

# Local editor / OS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
# CPU test evidence fetched from the lab hosts - output, not source.
# Commit a run deliberately when it is worth keeping as a reference.
ansible/reports/
# aitk-managed - do not commit (deployed from ai-toolkit)
# A project-own file under these paths needs an explicit `git add -f`.
.claude/skills/
.claude/rules/
.claude/commands/
.claude/agents/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
